<title>USA: TABLE - Wireless One Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Wireless One Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					   June 30,	  June 30,</p>
<p>			     1997	   1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  $ 8.3	 $ 1.5    $ 15.4	$ 2.4</p>
<p> Operating Expense	 5.7	   1.0	10.6	  2.1</p>
<p> SG&amp;A			  6.8	   2.6	13.0	  4.7</p>
<p> EBITDA		    (4.2)	 (2.1)     (8.2)	(4.4)</p>
<p>Depreciation and</p>
<p>   Amortization	    7.9	   1.3	14.2	  2.3</p>
<p> Interest Expense (Net)  9.1	   3.3	17.6	  6.1</p>
<p>Equity</p>
<p>    (Loss) on Investment(.2)	    --	(.3)	   --</p>
<p> Income Tax Benefit	 .7	    --	  .7	   --</p>
<p> Net Loss		 (20.7)	 (6.7)    (39.6)     (12.8)</p>
<p> Net Loss Per Share   (1.22)	 (.50)    (2.34)	(.95)</p>
<p>	     (in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Wireless One Inc said its second quarter and six-month results include costs related to inclement weather and non-recurring charges related to combining the company with TruVision Wireless Inc.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available to discuss the dollar effects of the inclement weather or the non-recurring charges.</p>
</text>
